      "clips": [
        {
          "segment_id": "title",
          "type": "title",
          "source_text": "Decide for Yourself",
          "file": "elevenlabs/en-us/2026-09-10-decide-for-yourself_title_en-us.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-09-12T15:59:35+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "ktkP7Nsj67dw2zcplQYt",
            "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "speed": 0.9,
            "similarity_boost": 1.0
          }
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:001",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "There are two kinds of parents. One is like your mom—she decides for you whether to use one quilt or two!",
          "file": "elevenlabs/en-us/2026-09-10-decide-for-yourself_dialogue_001_en-us.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-09-12T15:59:40+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "gOupLcAkjEnguROwi4oS",
            "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "speed": 0.9,
            "similarity_boost": 1.0
          },
          "sequence": "001",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:002",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "The other is like me—I get both quilts out and let you decide for yourself.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/en-us/2026-09-10-decide-for-yourself_dialogue_002_en-us.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-09-12T15:59:41+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "gOupLcAkjEnguROwi4oS",
            "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "speed": 0.9,
            "similarity_boost": 1.0
          },
          "sequence": "002",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:003",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Which do you think is better—deciding for yourself or having your mom decide?",
          "file": "elevenlabs/en-us/2026-09-10-decide-for-yourself_dialogue_003_en-us.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-09-12T15:59:45+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "gOupLcAkjEnguROwi4oS",
            "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "speed": 0.9,
            "similarity_boost": 1.0
          },
          "sequence": "003",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:004",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "I'll use a thick one!",
          "file": "elevenlabs/en-us/2026-09-10-decide-for-yourself_dialogue_004_en-us.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-09-12T15:59:47+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "7QN34D2r3hCNwbOYIeK0",
            "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "speed": 0.9,
            "similarity_boost": 1.0
          },
          "sequence": "004",
          "speaker": "child"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:005",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Isn't there a line from an old poem?",
          "file": "elevenlabs/en-us/2026-09-10-decide-for-yourself_dialogue_005_en-us.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-09-12T15:59:48+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "gOupLcAkjEnguROwi4oS",
            "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "speed": 0.9,
            "similarity_boost": 1.0
          },
          "sequence": "005",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:006",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "\"On the Love of the Lotus\"?",
          "file": "elevenlabs/en-us/2026-09-10-decide-for-yourself_dialogue_006_en-us.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-09-12T15:59:49+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "7QN34D2r3hCNwbOYIeK0",
            "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "speed": 0.9,
            "similarity_boost": 1.0
          },
          "sequence": "006",
          "speaker": "child"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:007",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "No, not that one. It's \"Ducks are the first to know when the river warms in spring.\"",
          "file": "elevenlabs/en-us/2026-09-10-decide-for-yourself_dialogue_007_en-us.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-09-12T15:59:53+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "gOupLcAkjEnguROwi4oS",
            "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "speed": 0.9,
            "similarity_boost": 1.0
          },
          "sequence": "007",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:008",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "It means that when spring comes, the ducks can tell whether the water is warm or hot.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/en-us/2026-09-10-decide-for-yourself_dialogue_008_en-us.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-09-12T15:59:55+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "gOupLcAkjEnguROwi4oS",
            "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "speed": 0.9,
            "similarity_boost": 1.0
          },
          "sequence": "008",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:009",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "When winter comes, you can tell for yourself whether you feel warm or cold. So I think it's better to let you decide.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/en-us/2026-09-10-decide-for-yourself_dialogue_009_en-us.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-09-12T15:59:57+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "gOupLcAkjEnguROwi4oS",
            "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "speed": 0.9,
            "similarity_boost": 1.0
          },
          "sequence": "009",
          "speaker": "father"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "track_id": "zh-CN-mandarin",
      "code": "zh-CN",
      "language": "汉语",
      "variant": "普通话",
      "clips": [
        {
          "segment_id": "title",
          "type": "title",
          "source_text": "自己决定",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-10-decide-for-yourself_title_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:001",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "父母有两种。一种像你妈妈，她帮你做决定：你是盖一床，还是盖两床！",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-10-decide-for-yourself_dialogue_001_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "001",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:002",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "另一种像我这样，我把两床被子都拿出来，你自己决定。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-10-decide-for-yourself_dialogue_002_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "002",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:003",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "你觉得哪种好？是你决定，还是你妈决定？",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-10-decide-for-yourself_dialogue_003_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "003",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:004",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "盖个厚的！",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-10-decide-for-yourself_dialogue_004_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "004",
          "speaker": "孩子"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:005",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "不是有一句古诗吗？",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-10-decide-for-yourself_dialogue_005_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "005",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:006",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "《爱莲说》吗？",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-10-decide-for-yourself_dialogue_006_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "006",
          "speaker": "孩子"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:007",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "不是《爱莲说》，是“春江水暖鸭先知”。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-10-decide-for-yourself_dialogue_007_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "007",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:008",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "就是说：春天到了，鸭子都知道水是暖的还是热的。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-10-decide-for-yourself_dialogue_008_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "008",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:009",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "冬天到了，冷还是热，你也是能感觉到的嘛。所以我觉得你自己决定好点。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-10-decide-for-yourself_dialogue_009_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "009",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "track_id": "es-ES-elevenlabs",
      "code": "es-ES",
      "language": "西班牙语",
      "variant": "西班牙本土西语",
      "clips": [
        {
          "segment_id": "title",
          "type": "title",
          "source_text": "Decide por ti mismo",
          "file": "elevenlabs/es-es/2026-09-10-decide-for-yourself_title_es-es.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T18:49:07+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "ZCh4e9eZSUf41K4cmCEL",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          }
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:001",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Hay dos tipos de padres. Uno es como tu madre: ella decide por ti si te tapas con un edredón o con dos.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/es-es/2026-09-10-decide-for-yourself_dialogue_001_es-es.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T18:49:11+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "LlZr3QuzbW4WrPjgATHG",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "001",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:002",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "El otro es como yo: saco los dos edredones y te dejo decidir.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/es-es/2026-09-10-decide-for-yourself_dialogue_002_es-es.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T18:49:13+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "LlZr3QuzbW4WrPjgATHG",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "002",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:003",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "¿Qué te parece mejor: decidir tú o que decida tu madre?",
          "file": "elevenlabs/es-es/2026-09-10-decide-for-yourself_dialogue_003_es-es.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T18:49:15+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "LlZr3QuzbW4WrPjgATHG",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "003",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:004",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "¡Usaré el grueso!",
          "file": "elevenlabs/es-es/2026-09-10-decide-for-yourself_dialogue_004_es-es.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T18:49:16+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "Nh2zY9kknu6z4pZy6FhD",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "004",
          "speaker": "child"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:005",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "¿No hay un verso de un poema antiguo que dice algo así?",
          "file": "elevenlabs/es-es/2026-09-10-decide-for-yourself_dialogue_005_es-es.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T18:49:18+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "LlZr3QuzbW4WrPjgATHG",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "005",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:006",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "¿*Sobre el amor al loto*?",
          "file": "elevenlabs/es-es/2026-09-10-decide-for-yourself_dialogue_006_es-es.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T18:49:19+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "Nh2zY9kknu6z4pZy6FhD",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "006",
          "speaker": "child"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:007",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "No, no es *Sobre el amor al loto*. Es: «Los patos son los primeros en saber que el río se calienta en primavera».",
          "file": "elevenlabs/es-es/2026-09-10-decide-for-yourself_dialogue_007_es-es.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T18:49:22+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "LlZr3QuzbW4WrPjgATHG",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "007",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:008",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Quiere decir que, cuando llega la primavera, los patos saben si el agua está templada o caliente.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/es-es/2026-09-10-decide-for-yourself_dialogue_008_es-es.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T18:49:25+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "LlZr3QuzbW4WrPjgATHG",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "008",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:009",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Cuando llega el invierno, tú también puedes sentir si tienes frío o calor. Por eso creo que es mejor que decidas tú.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/es-es/2026-09-10-decide-for-yourself_dialogue_009_es-es.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T18:49:28+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "LlZr3QuzbW4WrPjgATHG",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "009",
          "speaker": "father"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "track_id": "fr-FR-elevenlabs",
      "code": "fr-FR",
      "language": "法语",
      "variant": "法国法语",
      "clips": [
        {
          "segment_id": "title",
          "type": "title",
          "source_text": "Décide par toi-même",
          "file": "elevenlabs/fr-fr/2026-09-10-decide-for-yourself_title_fr-fr.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T19:50:48+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "aQROLel5sQbj1vuIVi6B",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
